# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Signing material and credentials: NEVER commit any of this.
# keys/private_key.pem signs .rcvup updates that every installed copy trusts;
# the Android keystore is required for in-place APK upgrades. Matched
# anywhere in the tree, not only in keys/, so a copy dropped beside the Gradle
# project or a Windows code-signing certificate is caught too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.snk
keystore.properties
keys/android-keystore.txt
.env
.env.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build and release output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
*.exe
*.rcvup
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
*.zip
SHA256SUMS.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# User data that must never be published: vault profiles, backups, exports,
# chat review files and sync caches. Real libraries live in %APPDATA% or the
# Android app sandbox; these patterns catch copies brought into the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# throwaway Electron profiles for driving the app in a test
# (--user-data-dir=./tmp-...). Chromium keeps them locked after exit.
tmp-*/
rolecraft-backup-*.json
*-review.json
*.dat
_xfer-hash-cache.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs, OS and editor files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local agent tooling. These folders can hold attached user documents,
# screenshots and session state; keep them out of the public repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.codex-remote-attachments/
.gradle-codex-*/
